### ==========================================================
### CATEGORIES — CRUD, filtros, archivar/restaurar (idempotentes),
### restaurar defaults (seedKey)
### (el registro ya siembra 10 categorías por defecto)
### ==========================================================
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@email = tester@test.com
@password = SecureP@ss123

# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{email}}", "password": "{{password}}" }

###

@token = {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### Listar todas (éxito) — las sembradas traen seedKey; todas traen createdAt/updatedAt
GET {{baseUrl}}/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Listar por tipo (éxito)
GET {{baseUrl}}/categories?type=EXPENSE
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Crear categoría (éxito) — icon es una clave Lucide del set curado (shared/icons.ts)
# @name createCat
POST {{baseUrl}}/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Café {{$randomInt 100 999}}", "icon": "coffee", "color": "BROWN", "type": "EXPENSE" }

###

@catId = {{createCat.response.body.id}}

### Get por id (éxito)
GET {{baseUrl}}/categories/{{catId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Update (éxito) — nombre/color/icon; el TYPE solo si no tiene transacciones
PUT {{baseUrl}}/categories/{{catId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Café y snacks", "color": "AMBER" }

### Archivar (soft delete) — libera el nombre para reuso
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/categories/{{catId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Archivar de nuevo — IDEMPOTENTE (200)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/categories/{{catId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get de la archivada por id — SÍ responde (archivedAt la distingue)
GET {{baseUrl}}/categories/{{catId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Reusar el nombre archivado (éxito, no choca con el archivado)
POST {{baseUrl}}/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Café y snacks", "type": "EXPENSE" }

### Ver archivadas
GET {{baseUrl}}/categories?includeArchived=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Restaurar la archivada
### (si otra activa ya tomó el nombre → 409: renombrar antes de restaurar)
POST {{baseUrl}}/categories/{{catId}}/restore
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Restaurar con OTRO nombre — salida al 409 cuando una categoría activa
### tomó el nombre; renombra y desarchiva en la misma escritura
POST {{baseUrl}}/categories/{{catId}}/restore
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Café recuperada {{$randomInt 100 999}}" }


### Restaurar defaults — recrea SOLO las categorías por defecto que falten
### (idempotente por seedKey; las archivadas cuentan como presentes)
POST {{baseUrl}}/categories/restore-defaults
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ---------- Casos de error ----------

### Duplicado case-insensitive — "CAFÉ Y SNACKS" ya existe como "Café y snacks" (409 DUPLICATE)
POST {{baseUrl}}/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "CAFÉ Y SNACKS", "type": "EXPENSE" }

### Cambiar el TYPE de una categoría CON transacciones (400 CATEGORY_TYPE_LOCKED)
### (crea una transacción con esta categoría primero — ver transactions.http)
# PUT {{baseUrl}}/categories/{{catId}}
# Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
# Content-Type: application/json
#
# { "type": "INCOME" }

### Update de una categoría ARCHIVADA (400 RESOURCE_ARCHIVED)
# PUT {{baseUrl}}/categories/{{catId}}
# Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
# Content-Type: application/json
#
# { "name": "no se puede" }

### Crear — icono fuera del set curado (400 VALIDATION)
### Solo se aceptan claves de CATEGORY_ICONS (= DESIGN.md §4.3)
POST {{baseUrl}}/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Icono raro", "icon": "taco", "type": "EXPENSE" }

### Crear — color inválido (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "X", "color": "NEON" }

### Crear — sin nombre (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "icon": "coffee" }

### ==========================================================
### O-B1 — id del cliente (offline). Re-ejecutable: la segunda
### corrida responde 200 (replay) en vez de 201.
### ==========================================================

### Crear con id propio (201 la primera vez, 200 el replay)
POST {{baseUrl}}/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "id": "019a0000-0b01-7000-8000-0000000000c1", "name": "Offline cat", "icon": "coffee", "type": "EXPENSE" }

### Replay idéntico (200)
POST {{baseUrl}}/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "id": "019a0000-0b01-7000-8000-0000000000c1", "name": "Offline cat", "icon": "coffee", "type": "EXPENSE" }

### Mismo id, icono distinto (409 ID_TAKEN)
POST {{baseUrl}}/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "id": "019a0000-0b01-7000-8000-0000000000c1", "name": "Offline cat", "icon": "car", "type": "EXPENSE" }
